### Pattern 2: Cypress Intercept

```typescript
// Mock API calls
cy.intercept("GET", "/api/users", {
  statusCode: 200,
  body: [
    { id: 1, name: "John" },
    { id: 2, name: "Jane" },
  ],
}).as("getUsers");

