## JSON Path Notation

Validation uses JSON Path to identify fields:

| Path | Description |
|------|-------------|
| `$.form` | Root form object |
| `$.form.name` | Name field |
| `$.form.tab1.email` | Email field in tab1 |
| `$.form.items[0].value` | First item's value |
| `$.form.items[*].name` | All item names |

